        "Description": "47, got a bit of an unusual one for you today-\r\rOur client has discovered that Ether master login credentials are being temporarily kept on-site in an art exhibition in the Burj Al-Ghazali as part of a handoff to Omar Al-Ghazali. They have requested we eliminate their undercover security detail to allow them to freely intercept the credentials. \r\rHappy Heisting 47- and don&apos;t forget a good thief always checks every angle.",
